1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,530
If you put THIS in your mouth,

2
00:00:01,530 --> 00:00:02,670
you can play video games

3
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:03,690
with your TONGUE.

4
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:04,450
Seriously.

5
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:05,190
Watch this.

6
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:06,470
It's called the MouthPad.

7
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:07,890
And that tiny gold square?

8
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:08,670
It's a touchpad

9
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:10,130
sitting on the roof of your mouth.

10
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:10,970
Move your tongue,

11
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,080
your character moves.

12
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:12,890
Tilt your head,

13
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:13,910
you AIM.

14
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:14,860
Press your tongue up,

15
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:15,780
you CLICK.

16
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,400
And people are already using this thing

17
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,960
to control computers and phones

18
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:19,950
without their hands.

19
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:21,670
But here's the craziest part.

20
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:22,530
Close your mouth,

21
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,000
and nobody can even SEE

22
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:24,890
the controller.

23
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,630
So imagine losing a video game

24
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,830
to someone who's literally

25
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:28,940
just sitting there...

26
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,670
With their mouth SHUT.

